# Chapter 11's three spheres, written as a scene file: matte, glass with an
# air bubble, and fuzzy gold, on a yellow ground.
camera aspect 16 9
camera vfov 90
camera lookfrom 0 0 0
camera lookat 0 0 -1

material ground lambertian 0.8 0.8 0.0
material navy   lambertian 0.1 0.2 0.5
material glass  dielectric 1.5
material bubble dielectric 0.6666666666666666
material gold   metal 0.8 0.6 0.2 1.0

sphere  0.0 -100.5 -1.0 100.0 ground
sphere  0.0    0.0 -1.2   0.5 navy
sphere -1.0    0.0 -1.0   0.5 glass
sphere -1.0    0.0 -1.0   0.4 bubble
sphere  1.0    0.0 -1.0   0.5 gold
